\description{
Fits Bayesian vector autoregressive models for multiple subjects using products of Dirichlet process mixtures. Subjects can share autoregressive coefficients through a single partition across all lags, separate partitions by lag, or separate partitions by response node. Residual covariance matrices have a separate subject partition. Provides Markov chain Monte Carlo sampling and diagnostics for comparing fits across chains. The models are described in Kundu and Lukemire (2024) \url{https://jmlr.org/papers/v25/22-0717.html}.
